' Both parts on the ground; the result goes down where he stands.
mapclick 75,303
wait 10
menu 150,160
menuline 1
wait 3
uiclick 204,248          ' the ammunition down
wait 3
uiclick 168,248          ' the rifle down
wait 3
uiclick r300,118         ' right-click the rifle on the ground (its second slot)
wait 3
uiclick 169,206          ' "OK, make me loaded rifle."
wait 3
snap h1_on_ground
esc
wait 3
save
quit
